rt**: Quick (< 1 hour)\n\n**Data Source**: DeepReport Intelligence Briefing (cycle 12), mined from discussion #66578 ([Claude Code User Documentation Review - 2026-10-07](https://github.com/github/gh-aw/discussions/66578)).\n\n\n<!-- gh-aw-tracker-id: deep-report-intel-agent -->\n\n> Generated by [🔬 Deep Report](https://github.com/github/gh-aw/actions/runs/37667406820) · claude · agent · 274.9 AIC · ⌖ 8.85 AIC · ⊞ 7.1K · [◷](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Agithub%2Fgh-aw+is%3Aissue+%22gh-aw-workflow-call-id%3A+github%2Fgh-aw%2Fdeep-report%22&type=issues)\n> - [x] expires <!-- gh-aw-expires: 2026-10-09T18:48:13.589Z --> on Oct 9, 2026, 10:48 AM UTC-08:00\n\n<!-- gh-aw-agentic-workflow: Deep Report, gh-aw-tracker-id: deep-report-intel-agent, engine: claude, model: agent, id: 37667406820, workflow_id: deep-report, run: https://github.com/github/gh-aw/actions/runs/37667406820 -->\n\n<!-- gh-aw-workflow-id: deep-report -->\n<!-- gh-aw-workflow-call-id: github/gh-aw/deep-report -->","closed_by":{"login":"pelikhan","id":4175913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzU5MTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4175913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan","html_url":"https://github.com/pelikhan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pelikhan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/github/gh-aw/